+## 9E. IC-7 — Inventory Security / Write-Boundary Closure + Module-Boundary Audit
+
+**✅ DONE (2026-09-17)**.
+
+**Goal, restated**: close every remaining raw-write gap architecture
+doc §9's own table listed as open, verify the full function/grant
+matrix end to end, and audit module-boundary/dependency direction
+(generic Inventory Core must not depend on business-domain logic).
